// Syncthing shares between the admin's machines exactly what git refuses to
// carry: the per-installation Pulumi stack config, the private network
// description, this installation's own service catalog and the golden that pins
// what those services deploy. Everything else in this directory is git's — first
// match wins, so the trailing * ignores all of it.
//
// A directory has to be listed for the files under it to be reachable, which is
// what the bare !/src, !/src/config and !/tests lines are for: they carry the
// directory entry, not its contents.
//
// Syncthing does not sync .stignore itself, which is why this file is tracked
// in git: every clone gets the same ignore set.
!/Pulumi.raspi.yaml
!/src/config/all.ts
!/src/config/hosts.ts
!/src/config/services.local.ts
!/src/config
!/src
!/tests/golden.local.test.ts
!/tests/__snapshots__/golden.local.test.ts.snap
!/tests/__snapshots__
!/tests
!/state
!/.env
*
